  "notes": "Run 2 library declustering, libA setup, on the numba clustering + per-process library + consolidated library files. Carry fields: btagScore, jetId, nConstituents, energy fractions (not puId: Run 2 drops puId<6 jets below 50 GeV). No missing chunks; event counts equal the Run 2 PDF roast. Whole roast ~2.5 h. D.6 SvB sentinel (declustered 0.66, original 0.15) explained: the Run 2 SvB is multi-class and ps_hh is only defined when HH is the largest signal class. SR yield shares (HH/ZZ/ZH-largest/all p<=0.01): original ggHH 0.85/0.04/0.11/0.00, declustered ggHH 0.34/0.30/0.35/0.01, declustered data 0.26/0.39/0.32/0.03 (Run 3's binary SvB has no ZZ/ZH channel). The report counts sentinels in its fraction denominators, so the fractions and yield ratios stand. Open: the SR column of the D.4 closure despite blinded upstream B.1 histograms.",
